+# Deploying the Base USDC Tip Jar
+
+This project ships as a static Next.js export suitable for IPFS. Do not upload from local development unless you intend to publish.
+
+## 1. Deploy the Contract to Base
+
+Use a real deployer keystore with enough Base ETH for gas. The deployer becomes the tip recipient.
+
+```bash
+export ALCHEMY_API_KEY=<alchemy-api-key>
+export ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=<basescan-api-key>
+
+yarn deploy --network base --keystore <your-foundry-keystore-name>
+```
+
+Confirm `packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts` contains a `8453` entry for `USDCTipJar`.
+
+```bash
+rg "8453|USDCTipJar" packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts
+```
+
+## 2. Build Static IPFS Output
+
+Set the final gateway or ENS URL before building so metadata does not point at localhost.
+
+```bash
+cd packages/nextjs
+rm -rf .next out
+
+NEXT_PUBLIC_TARGET_NETWORK=base \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_PRODUCTION_URL="https://<your-name>.eth.link" \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_RPC_URL="https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/$ALCHEMY_API_KEY" \
+NODE_OPTIONS="--require ./polyfill-localstorage.cjs" \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_IPFS_BUILD=true \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_IGNORE_BUILD_ERROR=true \
+yarn build
+```
+
+Verify the static output before uploading:
+
+```bash
+test -f out/index.html
+ls out/*/index.html
+grep -R "Base USDC Tip Jar" out/index.html out/_next/static/chunks/app
+grep -R "localhost" out/index.html || true
+```
+
+## 3. Upload to IPFS
+
+Run the upload only after the build output is verified:
+
+```bash
+cd packages/nextjs
+yarn bgipfs upload config init -u https://upload.bgipfs.com
+yarn bgipfs upload out
+```
+
+Save the returned CID:
+
+```bash
+export CID=<returned-cid>
+```
+
+## 4. Post-Deploy Verification
+
+Gateway checks:
+
+```bash
+curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -L "https://community.bgipfs.com/ipfs/$CID/"
+curl -s -L "https://community.bgipfs.com/ipfs/$CID/" | grep "Base USDC Tip Jar"
+curl -s -L "https://community.bgipfs.com/ipfs/$CID/" | grep "og:image"
+```
+
+Contract checks on Base:
+
+```bash
+export BASE_RPC_URL="https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/$ALCHEMY_API_KEY"
+export TIP_JAR=<deployed-tip-jar-address>
+export USDC=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913
+
+cast call $TIP_JAR "usdc()(address)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+cast call $TIP_JAR "recipient()(address)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+cast call $TIP_JAR "totalTips()(uint256)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+cast call $USDC "balanceOf(address)(uint256)" $(cast call $TIP_JAR "recipient()(address)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL) --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+```
+
+ENS content hash update, if using an ENS name:
+
+```bash
+# Set the ENS content hash in the ENS app to:
+# ipfs://$CID
+```
+
+After ENS propagation:
+
+```bash
+curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -L "https://<your-name>.eth.link/"
+curl -s -L "https://<your-name>.eth.link/" | grep "Base USDC Tip Jar"
+```
